# Hycadia pipe and fitting database - USER EDITABLE.
#
# Pipe dimensions and fitting equivalent lengths used by PHCP.  Edit this file
# to add or correct data; the report prints the file name and its SHA-256, so
# every calculation is traceable to the exact data it used.  Change the
# DATASET line whenever the content changes.
#
# Format: one record per line, fields separated by "|".  Lines starting with
# "#" are comments.  A value of DASH means "no value published": the program
# treats it as missing data and stops, never as zero.
DATASET|Hycadia pipe and fitting database|28 October 2026

